{"title":"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/3/6b3a13e758f57a1949d07885123b46df9b85159c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1,\\ x_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"51\" height=\"13\" /> are the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Root\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Root\">roots</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quadratic_equation\" title=\"Quadratic equation\">equation</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/7/2b72375eb3949da44474077af4e7abffa1c35c92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle x^2+ax+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"124\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/1/d41cb6a80566f3535cfb9e6dc338c0bc293b843c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_3,\\ x_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"48\" height=\"11\" /> are the roots of the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/2/be28cdaf0409fd753d20a74b0653a315d9fbcb41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle x^2+bx+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"122\" height=\"16\" />, then the expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/8/a083ff539530ffc35fda54b917a22bb36ff31356.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x_1}{x_2x_3x_4}+\\frac{x_2}{x_1x_3x_4}+ \\frac{x_3}{x_1x_2x_4}+\\frac{x_4}{x_1x_2x_3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"299\" height=\"37\" /> equals to \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/e/10ed45c7b09855cb89b89e68b77943014ffcec5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } a^2+b^2-2\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } a^2+b^2\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } \\frac{a^2+b^2}{2}\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } a^2+b^2+1\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } a^2+b^2-4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"670\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/9/179c2d5255cac58f5b8df4821b000be75c6738ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle (x - x_1)(x - x_2) = x^2 + ax + 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"277\" height=\"19\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/d/76d3ce614f92ed23ebb71d33755414fee29364ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = -(x_1 + x_2) \\displaystyle$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"118\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/4/1c449fac4b8146625caf5e8a4834a2c168f5b691.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1 \\cdot x_2 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"81\" height=\"14\" /> (the same goes for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/4/d84b65961f5b81a91658bbd635d06390e3f7a562.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b,\\ x_3,\\ x_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"70\" height=\"16\" />).\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/0/4e09c1ebddeb06c7d66da3fa7519e4c7ca1c00df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x_1}{x_2x_3x_4}+\\frac{x_2}{x_1x_3x_4} = \\frac{x_1}{x_2} + \\frac{x_2}{x_1} = \\frac{x_1^2 + x_2^2}{x_1 \\cdot x_2}  = x_1^2 + x_2^2 = (x_1 + x_2)^2 - 2x_1x_2 = a^2 - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"638\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>Similarly (for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/4/d84b65961f5b81a91658bbd635d06390e3f7a562.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b,\\ x_3,\\ x_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"70\" height=\"16\" />) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/f/fdf5faced18429658274975c69bbf2267f1fc20f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x_3}{x_1x_2x_4} + \\frac{x_4}{x_1x_2x_3} = b^2 - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"207\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p>So\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/2/ce2b8a00f77471548978eb720c275a9f6a7f7f08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x_1}{x_2x_3x_4}+\\frac{x_2}{x_1x_3x_4}+ \\frac{x_3}{x_1x_2x_4}+\\frac{x_4}{x_1x_2x_3} = a^2 + b^2 - 4 \\Longrightarrow \\mathrm{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"458\" height=\"35\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2007 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_12\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_14\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyce